# DrumMania (GQ881 VER. JAD): a game, from the NVRAM drmn-install.his leaves (the flash written).
# Power-on: the flash check, then attract with the title (frame ~1200); two coins, Start through
# the screens to the music select's default; the stage played on the pads: the snare every 8
# frames, the hi-hat every 16, the bass drum every 12, a tom or the cymbal now and then. Hashes the
# main RAM every frame, snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game drmn

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 1400 press "Coin 1" 8
at 1440 press "Coin 1" 8
at 1600 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 1900 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 2200 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 2500 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 2800 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 3100 every 8 press "Snare" 4
from 3104 every 16 press "Hi-Hat" 4
from 3102 every 12 press "Bass Drum" 4
from 3110 every 48 press "High Tom" 4
from 3134 every 48 press "Low Tom" 4
from 3150 every 96 press "Cymbal" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 11000 quit
